# Build output
*.exe
*.o

# Windows resource blob. Regenerated from icon/recicon.rc by the Makefile rule, so the
# source of truth (the .rc and the .ico) is versioned and the derived COFF is not.
*.res

# Third party runtime libraries. Not vendored on purpose: SDL3 and SDL3_image are
# versioned upstream, and a repository should not be the place people get their copy
# from. See README.md for where they come from and where they go.
*.dll

# Upstream packages downloaded during setup
*.zip

# Lucida Console ships with Windows and is Bigelow & Holmes property - usable on a
# machine that already has it, never redistributable from a public repository. It is no
# longer asked for: the shipped face is font/DejaVuSansMono.ttf, which is monospaced AND
# redistributable. The rule stays so a stray copy in font/ cannot be committed by
# accident. See CLAUDE.md section 5.
font/lucon.ttf

# Frame captures taken while verifying rendering
shot.png

# The project list is per machine: it holds absolute paths to folders on THIS disk, so
# committing it would hand every clone a list of directories that do not exist there.
projects.vngproj
